    },
    {
      "id": "file:src/routes/reports.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "reports.js",
      "filePath": "src/routes/reports.js",
      "summary": "报表与图表路由，提供 GET /reports 页面：解析时间范围（月/季/年/自定义/全部）后，调用 txn 库生成汇总、分类占比、趋势、成员分布、净值等十余项统计数据并渲染 reports 视图，含同期对比与星期分布分析。",
      "tags": ["api-handler", "报表", "statistics", "ssr", "express-router"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "parseRange 支持 month/year/quarter/custom/all 五种 preset，季度和年份边界由字符串拼接生成，end 统一用 -31 由 SQL BETWEEN 语义兜底。"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/routes/reports.js:parseRange",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "parseRange",
      "filePath": "src/routes/reports.js",
      "lineRange": [12, 40],
      "summary": "将查询参数解析为报表时间区间，支持月（默认）、年、季度、自定义起止日与全部时间五种预设，返回 start/end/label/key 供查询与页面展示。",
      "tags": ["utility", "日期解析", "validation", "报表"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/routes/reports.js:GET /reports",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "GET /reports",
      "filePath": "src/routes/reports.js",
      "lineRange": [42, 97],
      "summary": "报表主页面处理器：调用 txn 库生成收支汇总、分类/子分类占比、月度趋势、每日分布、成员分布、净值与账户总览，并计算同期对比（上月、去年同期）、星期消费分布、笔数均值与记账天数后渲染 reports 模板。",
      "tags": ["api-handler", "报表", "statistics", "ssr", "event-handler"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:src/routes/subscriptions.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "subscriptions.js",
      "filePath": "src/routes/subscriptions.js",
      "summary": "订阅扣费路由，覆盖订阅的完整生命周期：列表、编辑页、新建、更新、立即扣费一期、跳过本期、暂停/恢复、取消与删除，内置常用订阅服务（Netflix、Spotify 等）快选预设，所有写操作均带 requireLedgerWrite 鉴权与审计日志。",
      "tags": ["api-handler", "express-router", "订阅管理", "ssr", "audit"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "表单解析对每个字段做范围钳制（如 cycle_n 限 1-12、anchor_day 限 1-31、reminder_days 限 0-60）并统一截断长度，过期扣费日通过 while 循环按周期顺延（guard 上限 500 防死循环）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/routes/subscriptions.js:readForm",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "readForm",
      "filePath": "src/routes/subscriptions.js",
      "lineRange": [33, 69],
      "summary": "将表单体解析并校验为订阅字段：解析金额（分）、计费周期与锚点日、试用结束日与状态；未填下次扣费日时按试用结束日或今天兜底，且过期日期通过 subs.advance 按周期循环顺延。",
      "tags": ["validation", "表单解析", "utility", "日期计算"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/routes/subscriptions.js:GET /subscriptions",
